{
  "slug": "tsm",
  "name": "Tsm",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "Manage Transmission BitTorrent client from Claude Code. Add torrents, monitor downloads, set per-file priorities, apply seeding policies by label, bulk-replace trackers, and automate torrent workflows, all through natural language. Supports JSON output for scripting, macOS Keychain auth, multi-server profiles, and advanced filtering (e.g., \"ratio>2.0 AND label:movies AND age<7d\").",
  "longDescription": "Ships **1 skill**, `tsm` (Manage Transmission BitTorrent client via the tsm CLI).\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install tsm@claude-community` from `lu-zhengda/tsm`.\n\nA CLI for Transmission BitTorrent client.\n\nManage Transmission BitTorrent client from Claude Code. Add torrents, monitor downloads, set per-file priorities, apply seeding policies by label, bulk-replace trackers, and automate torrent workflows, all through natural language. Supports JSON output for scripting, macOS Keychain auth, multi-server profiles, and advanced filtering (e.g., \"ratio>2.0 AND label:movies AND age<7d\").",
  "compatibility": [
